// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - BugsClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P310712175" "Psychic Foci"
// DetailString :
"P3644488521" "These devices emit a specific psychic signature that certain members of the Resistance can listen in on. Since they don't transmit data electronically they won't show up on scanners, and since they don't broadcast any information that the seers aren't already aware of, they should be completely undetectable."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - ChemClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P823842783" "Vial of NAT-552"
// DetailString :
"P1959882324" "Aaron Walker suggested that you steal some of the very expensive chemicals in the lab to mask the planting of the psychic foci, but specifically he requested you steal a chemical called NAT-552. You aren't sure what he wants it for, but here it is."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - NAT552Clue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P704541230" "Data on NAT-552"
// DetailString :
"P3782557645" "According to the computer archives, the chemical compound called NAT-552 is a dangerous chemical that can cause permanent damage to the brain's synapses and death in doses as small as a single milligram.<br><br>Test results also indicate that it intensifies the firing of neural synapses, and increases transmission speed between the neuro-emitters and their axons, improving mental celerity by nearly 1000%. The results also warn that the substance is highly addictive in even the most impure state and repeated use causes irreperable damage to the cerebral cortex, burning out the neural transmitters and leaving the test subject in a permanent catatonic state."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P579546024" "Got the latest daily from the Resistance over the static this morning, along with a delivery a few days back. I've got the required drops all layed out, man, you wanna help me quest complete this thing?"
// AcceptString :
"P2865047185" "Accept"
// SendOffString :
"P1857277448" "So, a few cycles back I got these three trashloot pens delivered to me from a Resistance contact of mine. Man, I analyzed the crazy out of those things, they were straight up gray trash. Nothing special about them, trust me. I even put them through the spectrometer.<br><br>Static today had a special burst just for me. Two words, man, Psychic Foci! BAM!<br><br>Totally undetectable. Resistance have their own mental-cases that can focus in on it, snag any thoughts out of the air around it without anyone the wiser. Straight up PVP style, man!<br><br>What I need you for is to plant the foci in one of Neuron's labs, and while you're at it, I need you to cover your tracks and get me a little something I need."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2959036660" "Infiltrate one of Neuron's labs"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3612115817" "You need to get that thing taken care off we talked about earlier."

