// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3487128531" "What's the refresh, 'pearl'? Did the loot drop, or were you forced to 'dee-cee'?<br><br>Right, 'streeter-speak', I forget sometimes. Did you get the NAT-552 or not?<br><br>Perfect, perfect.<br><br>I assume you also planted the psychic foci.<br><br>Good, that'll please the Resistance. Hey, let's have the NAT-552, yes?<br><br>I know what you're gonna 'tell'. I'm 'perma'd' as is. I figure I can at least do some good for the resistance before I make like a tree.<br><br>I gotta be careful with this stuff though, gotta regulate it or I'll burn up. Trouble is, if I take too little then the ICE will flip my switch, hard crash.<br><br>It's a dangerous world in there. I'm risking my 'av' no different from you, I just need my super juice to do it.<br><br>Just remember, {HeroName}, we're all gonna be ash one day, I say it's better to burn out in history than fade away to nothing."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - P_SL3_NT_Walker_R_Task2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - CandaceMeyersClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P786523023" "Candace Meyers"
// DetailString :
"P2332067867" "Candace Meyers went missing two weeks ago. The resistance whispers of her being taken by the PPD and erased. Everyone gave up on her except for Aaron Walker, omni-presence of the net, who uncovered mention of her in the databanks of a genetic research lab before the ICE forced him to Dee-Cee. What is she doing in their database?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - EvidenceClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1196233949" "Genetics Patient Roster"
// DetailString :
"P3501969526" "Candace Meyers name is on this roster listed under something called Project: Butterfly. Before you could access more information the computer system shut down, locked by automated internal security along with a security breach alert."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - CrowClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3902112328" "A man named Crow"
// DetailString :
"P2418281249" "Aaron Walker sent you down into Resistance territory to talk to a man named Crow. Apparently he knows the tunnels pretty well, and he should be able to help you find out where Candace ended up when she got dumped down there."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - CandaceClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1386300398" "Where's the Girl?"
// DetailString :
"P4245347279" "The Radiant Servant told you everything you wanted to know, with great enthusiasm. He knew exactly who you were talking about and told you that he was blessed to have met her before she was taken to the radiant altar."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - CandacesEffectsClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1710209029" "Candace's Clothing"
// DetailString :
"P3934786352" "You locate some clothing on the radiant altar, they're womens clothing. Neatly folded and stacked. Inside one of the pockets you find a work ID card with Candace's name and picture. Where is the body though?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - IsotopeTerritoryClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2384382591" "Children of Isotope Territory"
// DetailString :
"P734567701" "Crow tells you how to make your way into the heart of the territory claimed by the warped Children of Isotope. You hope that you can find Candace Meyers there, but fear she has met with a grisly fate."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - GoddessIsotopeClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3892352032" "The Goddess Isotope?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P696830061" "I almost got fried by some wicked black ICE. I can't get into Neuron Technologies Unlimited, so I'm going to need your help. There's a woman missing, and I'm sure she's there."
// SendOffString :
"P3026184137" "The woman's name is Candace Meyers, she's the sister of one of our Resistance buildies. She went offline a few weeks ago, according to the static, so I did some digging and found mention of her in the NTU databanks, that's when the ICE hit me.<br><br>I need you to get inside and find Candace, and get her out of their. Either they found out her brother is in the Resistance, or they're looking to do some experimentation on her. Either way, every minute she spends in that fortress, the more likely she is going to end up on a corpse run."

