// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - P_SL3_NT_Walker_R_Task2_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2639208372" "Return to Aaron Walker"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2513198460" "So she IS in there. Or rather, WAS.<br><br>These records say that they disposed of her, let me do a little cross checking. Yep, looks like the disposal facility is right over a known experiment dumping grounds.<br><br>Neuron runs a lot of experiments, but the biggest one is one that most people don't realize is even going on. He drops his test subjects into the tunnels, and watches the results as they fight for survival down here, and fight against the Resistance. He figures if you slam enough problems into one another, the net equation will eventually zero out. Only I plan to stop him before that happens.<br><br>I know a guy who runs with the Resistance who might know a thing or two about that section of tunnels, his name is Crow."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - P_SL3_NT_Walker_R_Task2_Part3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P217387007" "Talk to Crow"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3853340468" "Walker sent you, hmm? Well, I think I might be able to help you find where you need to go, but once you get there you will be on your own.<br><br>That section of tunnels is deep in the territory of the Children of Isotope, some of Neuron's most recent failed experiments. You might be familiar with the ghouls, but these guys are even worse. Walking Neutron furnaces. They spew radiation out at immense levels, and apparently worship some sort of radioactive goddess that they call Isotope. Totally insane.<br><br>Even if this woman, Candace, did end up down there, the place is chock full of toxic waste gathered up by the Children to build their radiant altars. If they got their hands on her, there is little chance she is still alive."

