"P97047070" "Return to Crow"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P539898978" "I don't know what to say, {HeroName}. Chances are she's dead, but then again, chances were against you even locating her down there. From the sound of it, the Children of Isotope seem pretty keen on this young girl. I don't know their faith very well, but what I do know is that they believe that the radiation emitted by their 'radiant altars' casts off the false garments of the flesh and reveals who you really are. If Neuron's experimentation made her resistant to radiation, then they might think she is one of them.<br><br>You seem pretty keen on finding this girl, regardless of her fate. I'm going to tell you where to find the heart of the Children of Isotope's territory. I have a feeling that they took her there."

