"P2017173277" "You did it!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - P_SL3_NT_Walker_R_Task2_Part7 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2168954130" "You found her! I can't believe it. Thanks {HeroName}, I'm helping Candace work through her ordeal right now, and we're working on locating her brother to let him know she's alive. Do me a favor and let Aaron Walker know how much Candace appreciates him not giving up on finding her, we all owe him some thanks for this one."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P593000802" "Wow, that's some story. I'm glad to hear Candace is alive. I was catching the static about your exploits while you were down there. Sweet stuff, man. I also hear they got ahold of Candace's brother and he's on his way to Resistance Central right now to meet up with her. Good job, man! Good job!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - P_SL3_NT_Walker_R_Task3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - CableSplicingClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3630975518" "Spliced Power Cables"
// DetailString :
"P1241744409" "From the looks of this junction box the clockwork aren't regulating power surges through the lines, they're diverting power to somewhere else."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - MetronomeIsHereClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P937281629" "Metronome is here!"
// DetailString :
"P2299569373" "The presence of so many metronome controlled clockwork tells you that Metronome MUST be present down here."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - MetronomeClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2854913258" "Metronome"
// DetailString :
"P2334189325" "You found and defeated the bizarre computer virus infesting the clockwork, known only as Metronome. What is it after, what are it's motives?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4247905848" "We've got major power surges and losses blasting through the lines, disrupting static and blowing out unprotected systems. Word is that the clockwork are doing something to the lines down in the tunnels. We need your help."
// SendOffString :
"P85723017" "My guess is that AntiMatter is trying to kick us off the grid and sent his clockwork down to carry out the operation. This is a great opportunity to not only become a thorn in his side, but to also bolster our ranks with some fresh clockwork. Bust them up, the clean up teams will salvage what we can, and the grid will be back to normal."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P232854637" "Stop the Power Surges"

